    <!-- The subscription-refresh notification. The title names the EVENT, not the preference that
         enables it: «Автоматически обновлять подписки» is a settings row and read as one in the
         shade. The text takes the RESOLVED подписка name (SubscriptionNaming), never a raw remark —
         that is how «Обновляем «import sub»» reached the user — and falls back to a whole sentence
         when the подписка has no name yet, rather than to «Обновляем «»». -->
